      "content": "\"rest\" feels like a joke. even when i sleep, i'm just dreaming about the bills and the people i've let down. i don't want a nap or a vacation, i just want the noise to stop. i want the whole thing to just be over. it feels like the only way to actually get some peace is to just... stop being part of all this. like, how can anyone be expected to keep going when there's literally nothing left to give?",
